7:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"Overview"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400","children":"The RathRath bot lets you participate in Solana DAO governance (Realms) directly from Telegram—no browser or wallet extension required."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-base font-semibold","children":"What you can do"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-300","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Create and join DAOs"}]," — Group admins can create a new Realm (DAO) from Telegram. Members can deposit governance tokens to get voting power."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Propose and vote"}]," — Create on-chain proposals and cast Yes/No votes from the bot. The bot shows you a list of proposals so you don’t have to copy addresses."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Get smart alerts"}]," — Subscribe to DAOs and choose what you’re notified about: e.g. only proposals above a certain USD value, or only upgrade-authority changes."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Discover and follow delegates"}]," — See top delegates per DAO and delegate your voting power to someone you trust."]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-base font-semibold","children":"How it works"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300","children":["The bot uses a managed Solana wallet (via Privy) tied to your Telegram account. When you run commands like ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/deposit_power"}],","," ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/gov_propose"}],", or ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/gov_vote"}],", the bot builds the transaction and signs it with your wallet—you confirm in Telegram. All governance state lives on Solana (SPL Governance / Realms); the bot and its database only help you discover proposals, get alerts, and vote without leaving Telegram."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-base font-semibold","children":"Where to use the bot"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300","children":["Use the bot in ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"private chat"}]," for things like voting, depositing, and managing alerts. Some commands (e.g. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/createdao"}],") are intended for ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"group admins"}]," in the DAO’s Telegram group. If a command doesn’t respond in a group, try the same command in a direct message with the bot."]}]]}],null,["$","$La",null,{"children":["$","$b",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@c"}]}]]}]
